<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  PALETTE: Bone & Moss

  Warm bone neutrals with a deep green accent. Reads recovery/longevity rather than
  performance. The ink carries a green undertone (#1A1C18) so the accent feels native
  to the neutrals instead of applied on top of them.

  Moss IS the flush intent here, and it also serves as lpPositive — the one palette
  where accent and "good" legitimately coincide, since a recovery-coded system wants
  green to mean the same thing in both roles.
-->
